# config/messages.jp

[nsRecords]
closeComment: "Thanks for your interest in is-a.dev!\n\nThis pull request requests `NS` records. We do not grant nameserver records to first-time contributors, so I am closing this pull request.\n\nYou are welcome to open a new pull request using other record types, such as `A`, `AAAA`, `CNAME`, `MX` or `TXT`. Once you have an accepted registration, you can request `NS` records with a clear justification for why they are needed.\n\nPlease see the [Docs](https://docs.is-a.dev/faq/#who-can-use-ns-records) for more information.\n<sub>This comment was sent with an [automated tool](https://doughmination.gay/automated), and approved by a human. I do not see replies.</sub>"

[unsupportedCname]
reviewComment: "Your `CNAME` record points at a host that we do not support. Please point it at a supported host, or use another record type such as `A` or `AAAA`.\n\nIf you have requested a CloudFlare Worker, please use a legacy CloudFlare Pages project."
reviewDismissal: "Thanks, the `CNAME` record is fixed. Dismissing the requested changes."
reviewSummary: "Please see the inline comment on `CNAME`.\n<sub>This comment was sent with an [automated tool](https://doughmination.gay/automated), and approved by a human. I do not see replies.</sub>"

[noReplyEmail]
reviewComment: "Your `owner.email` value is a GitHub no-reply email address. We do not allow these on our service. Please update it to a personal email address or remove the `owner.email` field entirely, as it is optional."
reviewDismissal: "Thanks, `owner.email` is fixed. Dismissing the requested changes."
reviewSummary: "Please see the inline comment on `owner.email`.\n<sub>This comment was sent with an [automated tool](https://doughmination.gay/automated), and approved by a human. I do not see replies.</sub>"

[vercelLogin]
reviewComment: "Your website preview is not live: it redirects to the Vercel login page, so we cannot review it.\n\nTo make it public:\n\n1. Open your project dashboard on Vercel.\n2. Navigate to **Settings > Deployment Protection**.\n3. Toggle off **Vercel Authentication** (Require Login) and click **Save**.\n4. Test your link in an Incognito window to confirm it loads without a login prompt.\n<sub>This comment was sent with an [automated tool](https://doughmination.gay/automated), and approved by a human. I do not see replies.</sub>"
reviewDismissal: "Thanks, your website preview now loads without a login. Dismissing the requested changes."
reviewSummary: "Please see the comment on your website preview.\n<sub>This comment was sent with an [automated tool](https://doughmination.gay/automated), and approved by a human. I do not see replies.</sub>"
